{"id":"stench-stone","name":{"en":"Stench Stone","ja":"臭い石"},"desc":{"en":"Despite its pretty color, it gives off a pungent odor. If you have to liken it to something, it's like rotten eggs wedged in a horse's ass.","ja":"綺麗な色と裏腹に、強烈な悪臭を放つ石。例 えていうなら、卵の腐った匂いに近い。硫黄 に近い成分を持つので、錬金術士としては重 宝する材料。匂いにさえ我慢できれば。"},"level":5,"locations":[{"id":"arland-great-plains","name":{"en":"Arland Great Plains","ja":"アーランド南方大平原"}},{"id":"arland-wastelands","name":{"en":"Arland Wastelands","ja":"アーランド東の荒野"}},{"id":"continental-coastline","name":{"en":"Continental Coastline","ja":"大陸海岸線"}}],"traits":{"id":"very-stinky","name":{"en":"Very Stinky","ja":"とてもクサイ"}},"categories":[{"id":"ore","name":{"en":"(Ore)","ja":"（鉱石類）"},"icon":"totori-category-ore"},{"id":"poison","name":{"en":"(Poison)","ja":"（毒の材料）"},"icon":"totori-category-poison"},{"id":"spice","name":{"en":"(Spice)","ja":"（香料）"},"icon":"totori-category-spice"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":21}